        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "The employees know where to find the book you’re looking for. They are nice and cooperative. The place itself is clean and well-organized. Prices are not cheap though. Parking is available.",
        "time": 1743067426,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Greg Domagala",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101457648011392623745/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZV8kzZ14nIi5FfLiXd3FFQQUpdBhRAlJDUQujmHSfZIE30QWQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Very nice bookstore and they also have a selection of gifts paper supplies etc. The staff is friendly and gladly helps you find what you want. If they don't have something in stock they can order it. Smaller than their other locations but it still is big enough. Not too crowded as it's off the main road.",
